59
00:06:34.673 --> 00:06:42.039
<v Maya>Because before AI, filing a formal tax objection took real effort and legal knowledge. The cost to file was high.</v>

60
00:06:42.199 --> 00:06:54.269
<v Daniel>But now, these firms use an LLM to automatically ingest property data, draft thousands of highly specific, legally sound objections for thousands of homes, and just flood the municipality.</v>

61
00:06:54.369 --> 00:07:01.615
