112
00:13:32.515 --> 00:13:33.878
<v Daniel>That's the million dollar question.</v>

113
00:13:33.978 --> 00:13:38.468
<v Maya>You literally can't process them all. But if you make it harder to apply, you punish the people who need it the most.</v>

114
00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:47.349
