116
00:13:50.032 --> 00:13:58.220
<v Daniel>It is. It just means slapping friction based band-aids on the problem just to survive the immediate crisis day by day rather than fixing the systemic issue.</v>

117
00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:07.189
