120
00:14:16.126 --> 00:14:25.434
<v Daniel>Number two, develop a digital identity strategy. This prevents rate limit circumvention and bad faith spam without relying on fees that hurt the poor.</v>

121
00:14:25.554 --> 00:14:26.515
