123
00:14:38.229 --> 00:14:48.532
<v Maya>Which is terrifying for civil servants. And I think that emphasizes the real takeaway here for you listening. This entire deep dive proves this is a governance and institution story, not a technology story.</v>

124
00:14:48.992 --> 00:14:57.655
