125
00:14:58.027 --> 00:15:07.773
<v Maya>So just to recap briefly, AI has lowered the cost of interacting with the government so much that it is literally breaking the invisible friction that kept bureaucracies function.</v>

126
00:15:07.793 --> 00:15:14.978
<v Daniel>Yeah. Leaving us with this brutal, genuinely unresolved choice between unequal access and systemic collapse.</v>

127
00:15:15.198 --> 00:15:30.190
